      "flags": 0,
      "text": "With your skills, you could become a top leader\\nin Team Rocket!\\c\\nCome on, think of the opportunity!\\nYou shouldn’t let a chance like this pass you by!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0310_rocketm_12",
      "hash": "d0bbbe5f5b4e142c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Congratulations!\\nYou beat our five Trainers!"
    }
